    "turn_text": "That's great. As you've had a little bit of time to kind of look out over the horizon, how have your thoughts changed or evolved in terms of the leading grand strategic threats that the United States confront? If you had to say to your constituents, what's the top threat that the United States confronts right now? What would you say?",
