    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 50746,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50746.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 52,
    "turn_text": "It's a great way to put it. I mean, for so many of us, that's why we serve on the committee. That's why we came to Congress to begin with, to be a part of this effort. Again, it took a bipartisan effort to restore defense budgets to where they are in the Trump era, which really mirrors, we haven't seen this since the early Reagan era. When President Reagan came to office and had to restore, significantly restore and boost defense budgets, we're still benefiting from that today up to this point. Now, President Trump and this area working with Congress do the same thing. That's what so many of us came to Congress to be a part of.",
